  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Next Generation City Action</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This engagement will promote youth participation from developing countries in city planning by using the C40 Mayors Summit in Copenhagen as a platform. The grant will finance youth representatives from developing countries e.g. students, entrepreneurs or policy agents (influencers). Throughout the summit, the youth representatives will interact with city representatives, presenting ideas from their own countries or from their visits to Danish cities. Collaboration will be established with developing country universities and incubators to maximize the adoption of the solutions proposed by participating youth.</narrative>
  </description>
